  "description": "President Seo deeply cares for his people and his economy. Unfortunately, bureaucracy and red tape gum up every step he could possibly take to help. With his approval ratings plummeting, President Seo has no choice but to sit back and watch as his people turn him into the scapegoat for all their problems. That is, until he finds himself awaken one morning as Du Hyuk Ma, a notorious gang leader.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
